# ...except the SimConnect client library: it is a redistributable dependency (MIT licence, MSFS
# SDK), not a build artefact, and checking it in is what lets CI build the connect plugin without
# an SDK installation. See 3rdParty/SimConnect/README.md.
!3rdParty/SimConnect/lib/SimConnect.dll

